uch but it took  about six attempts for the recipe to  finally work and when it did we were all  relieved and ecstatic at the same time  during the shoot everything was fine  until the slicing of the finished cake  that's when anxiety kicked in for sure  would the cake read 2020 the only way to  find out was by slicing into it when i  saw the cake actually read 2020 i was so  happy the numbers were perfectly in  place and that we achieved what we set  out to that was a win for me then the  video received 50 million views in one  week i could not believe my eyes it's up  to over 60 million views now it just  goes to show that even when things  aren't going exactly as planned it  always helps to have hope so just keep  that in mind for 20 20.  thank you carly for sticking with me  through this recipe and thank you all  for watching  oh yes  [Music]  you
 

